>## Look up a binding by name in a graph, returning Either an error or the binding
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term dereferenceVariable = λgraph,name.optionals.match (lookupBinding graph name) left(errors.Error{resolution = errors.ResolutionError{noSuchBinding = errors.NoSuchBindingError{name = name}}}) (λ`right_`.right(`right_`))
