>
>## Match a term against an enum type, dispatching on the variant name to a value from the supplied list
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term matchEnum = λgraph,tname,pairs.matchUnion graph tname (lists.map (λpair.matchUnitField (pairs.first pair) (pairs.second pair)) pairs)
