>
>## Match a term against a record type and decode its fields, failing if the term is not a record
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term matchRecord = λgraph,decode,`term`.let stripped := strip.deannotateAndDetypeTerm `term` in cases(model.Term){`record`=λ`record`.decode (maps.fromList (lists.map (λfield.(model.Field[name] field, model.Field[`term`] field)) (model.Record[fields] `record`))), `_`=left(errors.Error{resolution = errors.ResolutionError{unexpectedShape = errors.UnexpectedShapeError{expected = "record", actual = print.model.term `term`}}})} stripped
