>
>## Strip annotations and type lambdas/applications from a term, then follow variable references through the graph until a non-variable term is reached
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term stripAndDereferenceTerm = λgraph,`term`.let stripped := strip.deannotateAndDetypeTerm `term` in cases(model.Term){variable=λv.eithers.bind (requireTerm graph v) (λt.stripAndDereferenceTerm graph t), `_`=right(stripped)} stripped
