>
>## Strip annotations and dereference variables, returning Either an error or the resolved term
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term stripAndDereferenceTermEither = λgraph,`term`.let stripped := strip.deannotateAndDetypeTerm `term` in cases(model.Term){variable=λv.eithers.either (λ`left_`.left(`left_`)) (λbinding.stripAndDereferenceTermEither graph (model.Binding[`term`] binding)) (dereferenceVariable graph v), `_`=right(stripped)} stripped
